            <div xml:id="d24">

                <pb facs="0134" n="14" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg14"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.6363/1068: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-02-26T17:00:00-05:00">February 26, 1931—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:45 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>25. My 22, February 25, 6 p.m. The final minor changes we wanted were made
                    yesterday by the House on motion of the Minister of Industries and the bill
                    passed in second debate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
